      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1359323388,
      "text": "Rosa bella is a species of flowering plant in the Rosaceae family. It belongs to the Rosa genus. This species is native to northern and eastern China. It is a shrub that grows in temperate environments. The species was first published in C.S. Sargent, Plantae Wilsonianae 2: 341 (1915)."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Rosa bella",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosa_bella",
